:: How .lang files work and how to implement your language
::
:: Lang files are were created to easily support multiple languages
:: inside an application
::
:: Any line starting with two columns is a comment and will be ignored
::
:: The first line of a file should always be the encoding of the file
:: and it's prefixed by !=
:: Example for a file that uses UTF-8 encoding
!=UTF-8
